  "ingredients": [
    "4 pounds corned beef brisket, or more to taste",
    "2 quarts water, or as needed to cover",
    "1 medium head cabbage, cored and cut into 6 wedges",
    "12 small red potatoes, halved",
    "1 pound small white onions, peeled",
    "6 large carrots, peeled and cut in chunks",
    "1 tablespoon unsalted butter",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon red wine vinegar",
    "0.5 cup reduced-fat sour cream",
    "2 tablespoons coarse Dijon mustard"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SI8Cmgj2RKvrJajQB93ueCsULuU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/239927-corned-beef-dinner-for-stpatricks-day-ddmfs-step1-3x4-6357-3b8c299997a944fd84a882e3bdf83c57.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239927/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the corned beef: Place corned beef into a 6-quart Dutch oven, and pour in enough water to cover by 2 inches. Bring to a boil, skimming the liquid occasionally to remove fat from the top. Reduce the heat to medium-low, cover, and simmer for 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iDlh4GcZpdZRvdKW-hNj3r2YVtc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/239927-corned-beef-dinner-for-stpatricks-day-ddmfs-step3-3x4-6487-1a138059a00b43d4824eca94b454251a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239927/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange cabbage, potatoes, onions, and carrots around beef; return to a boil. Reduce the heat to medium-low, cover, and simmer until vegetables are tender and beef can easily be pulled apart with a fork, about 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ffNMO2yCaVEGsmucQSUuVFy8GTA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/239927-corned-beef-dinner-for-stpatricks-day-ddmfs-step4-3x4-6490-134a819f1aaf47c99984cb5b3276418a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239927/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer beef to a serving platter. Remove vegetables with a slotted spoon and arrange around beef. Reserve 1 ½ cups cooking liquid for the sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i0OnK16fuhdpy2U6kbz177lOv1s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/239927-corned-beef-dinner-for-stpatricks-day-ddmfs-step6-3x4-6513-ce4502a7586e4c849712bf63f5a0fa8d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239927/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the sauce: Melt butter in a small saucepan over medium heat. Whisk flour into melted butter until dissolved and bubbling, about 1 minute. Add reserved cooking liquid and vinegar; cook, stirring frequently, until sauce is slightly thickened, about 4 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XJ2j06VX3JwUdqHKiwt9nXBSStg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/239927-corned-beef-dinner-for-stpatricks-day-ddmfs-step8-3x4-6522-73d173dea851493d9ef30526a2a117f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239927/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the heat and whisk in sour cream and mustard.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i_U2vE0dilI0omxVlGWRVJCwbAo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/239927-corned-beef-dinner-for-stpatricks-day-ddmfs-step9-3x4-6526-b0bec26fc4614f3c9ea1e016ba9b8aaf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239927/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve sauce alongside corned beef and vegetables.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/v7iAh2RfxhabNTnGuJd0OsLz1B0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/239927-corned-beef-dinner-for-stpatricks-day-ddmfs-3x4-6558-3bb704860ea14d2881874409326ab610.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239927/step_07.webp"
    }
